exports[`skills and command templates > each command renders per agent format > claude-code 1`] = `
"---
description: "Turn the Mandate flow (or its approval checkpoint) on or off for this agent client, or show it. The project policy can override it."
argument-hint: "on | off | status | approval on|off | questions mandate|chat"
---
<!-- managed by mandate -->
Load the current instructions for this command from Mandate: \`instructions_get {"name":"flow","args":"$ARGUMENTS","stubVersion":1}\`. Follow the returned \`text\`.
If that tool is missing or the Mandate server cannot be reached: stop and tell the user that Mandate is unreachable. Do not work from memory or from an older copy of these instructions.
<!-- mandate-stub v1 -->
"
`;

